+## Local storage directories
+
+These environment variables relocate the default tool-owned directories:
+
+| Variable | Default |
+|---|---|
+| `CASCETTE_CACHE_DIR` | `~/.cache/cascette` |
+| `CASCETTE_CONFIG_DIR` | `~/.config/cascette-tools` |
+| `CASCETTE_DATA_DIR` | `~/.local/share/cascette-tools` |
+
+Explicit constructor or application configuration paths take precedence. The
+installer's encoding lookup cache follows the application data directory.
+
